            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - Turnover Certificate for Current Account in Gurugram Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>CA turnover certificate = revenue proof for banks to open current account WITHOUT GST. GST not mandatory for account opening (RBI allows alternatives). Accepted by SBI, HDFC, ICICI, Axis, PNB, Kotak. Based on ITR or bank statements. Combine with Udyam registration for strongest package. From Rs 999, same-day. For freelancers, traders, e-commerce below GST threshold.</p>
                </div>
                <p>Many Gurugram businesses need current accounts before GST registration. For a comprehensive overview, see our <a href="/turnover-certificate-for-current-account">Turnover Certificate Current Account</a> national guide.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Business Type</th><th>Location</th><th>Why No GST</th><th>Patron Solution</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Freelance IT Consultant</td><td>DLF Cyber City</td><td>Receipts < Rs 20L (services)</td><td>Turnover cert from ITR-4 + Udyam</td></tr><tr><td>Small Retail Shop</td><td>Sector 46/56 Market</td><td>Turnover < Rs 40L (goods)</td><td>Turnover cert + Shop Act license</td></tr><tr><td>Coaching Centre</td><td>Sohna Road</td><td>Receipts < Rs 20L (services)</td><td>Turnover cert + address proof</td></tr><tr><td>Home E-Commerce Seller</td><td>Gurugram Residential</td><td>Below threshold (starting)</td><td>Turnover cert from bank stmt + Udyam</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p</p>
                <p>GST is one entity proof but NOT the only one. RBI KYC allows alternatives: CA turnover certificate, Udyam, Shop Act, ITR, professional registration. Patron provides the certificate + Udyam as a package for banks.</p>
